title: MoniStart
---
<<declare $trust = 0>>
Lona: Yo! I'm looking for Jason 
Lona: do u know where he is?
-> Who tf is Jason?
    <<set $trust to $trust + 1>>
    Lona: bruh...
-> yeah, I'll tell u if you gimme 5 dabloons
    Lona: I'm broke dawg
<<jump MoniEnd>>
===

title: MoniEnd
---
<<if $trust > 0>>
    Lona: nvm I guess
<<else>>
    Lona: Well... see you around, I guess.
<<endif>>
===